{"title":"Career Roadmap · Media Planner","role":"Media Planner","summary":"A Media Planner develops strategies for deciding where, when, and how a brand's advertising budget should be invested to reach the right audience. The role combines marketing, consumer behaviour, advertising, media research, campaign planning and data analytics.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For a student from BBA Sports / Event / Media Management, this is a strong pathway, particularly for sports marketing, entertainment, events, digital media, advertising agencies and brand partnerships."},{"type":"note","label":"Career positioning","text":"Media Planner is a realistic early-career role, although some organisations may hire fresh graduates as Media Planning Executive, Media Executive, Media Buying Executive, Digital Media Executive or Junior Media Planner before progressing to Media Planner."}]},{"heading":"Career Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Aspect","Details"],"rows":[[{"text":"Degree alignment"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ Strong"}],[{"text":"Entry level"},{"text":"Media Planning Executive / Media Executive"}],[{"text":"Core function"},{"text":"Advertising & media strategy"}],[{"text":"Main objective"},{"text":"Maximise audience reach and campaign effectiveness"}],[{"text":"Key areas"},{"text":"TV, digital, social, OTT, print, radio, outdoor"}],[{"text":"Analytical intensity"},{"text":"High"}],[{"text":"Communication requirement"},{"text":"High"}],[{"text":"Creative requirement"},{"text":"Moderate–High"}],[{"text":"PG requirement"},{"text":"Not mandatory"}],[{"text":"Best advantage"},{"text":"Marketing + media + analytics"}],[{"text":"Sports opportunity"},{"text":"Sports media, sponsorships, leagues, broadcasters and brands"}]]}]},{"heading":"What Does a Media Planner Do?","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Media Planner answers questions such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Who are we trying to reach?"},{"text":"Where does this audience spend time?"},{"text":"Which media channels should we use?"},{"text":"How much should we spend on each channel?"},{"text":"When should advertisements run?"},{"text":"How frequently should people see the advertisement?"},{"text":"How do we measure whether the campaign worked?"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A simplified workflow is:"},{"type":"h","text":"Business Objective"},{"type":"h","text":"Target Audience"},{"type":"h","text":"Consumer & Media Research"},{"type":"h","text":"Channel Selection"},{"type":"h","text":"Budget Allocation"},{"type":"h","text":"Media Plan"},{"type":"h","text":"Campaign Execution"},{"type":"h","text":"Performance Tracking"},{"type":"h","text":"Optimisation"},{"type":"h","text":"Campaign Report"}]},{"heading":"Media Planner vs Media Buyer","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"These roles are closely connected but different."},{"type":"table","header":["Media Planner","Media Buyer"],"rows":[[{"text":"Develops media strategy"},{"text":"Purchases media inventory"}],[{"text":"Determines channels"},{"text":"Negotiates placements"}],[{"text":"Allocates budget"},{"text":"Executes bookings"}],[{"text":"Defines target audience"},{"text":"Places campaigns"}],[{"text":"Forecasts reach/frequency"},{"text":"Manages campaign delivery"}],[{"text":"Analyses media effectiveness"},{"text":"Monitors delivery and cost"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"In smaller agencies, one professional may handle both planning and buying."}]},{"heading":"Media Channels You Should Understand","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Digital"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Google Search"},{"text":"YouTube"},{"text":"Instagram"},{"text":"Facebook"},{"text":"LinkedIn"},{"text":"Display advertising"},{"text":"Programmatic advertising"},{"text":"OTT/CTV"},{"text":"Mobile advertising"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Traditional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Television"},{"text":"Radio"},{"text":"Newspapers"},{"text":"Magazines"},{"text":"Outdoor advertising"},{"text":"Transit advertising"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Connected TV"},{"text":"Retail media"},{"text":"Influencer marketing"},{"text":"Creator advertising"},{"text":"Gaming advertising"},{"text":"Sports media"},{"text":"Digital out-of-home"},{"text":"AI-powered advertising"}]}]},{"heading":"Build Skills During the Degree","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Marketing Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build knowledge of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Principles of Marketing"},{"text":"Consumer Behaviour"},{"text":"Advertising"},{"text":"Business Communication"},{"text":"Economics"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Management"},{"text":"Digital Marketing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"STP — Segmentation, Targeting, Positioning"},{"text":"Marketing funnel"},{"text":"Brand awareness"},{"text":"Consideration"},{"text":"Conversion"},{"text":"Customer journey"},{"text":"Marketing objectives"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 2 — Media & Advertising","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Media fundamentals"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Media planning"},{"text":"Media buying"},{"text":"Audience segmentation"},{"text":"Media research"},{"text":"Campaign planning"},{"text":"Advertising objectives"},{"text":"Reach"},{"text":"Frequency"},{"text":"Impressions"},{"text":"Cost efficiency"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital advertising"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CPC"},{"text":"CPM"},{"text":"CTR"},{"text":"CPA"},{"text":"Conversion rate"},{"text":"ROAS"},{"text":"CAC"},{"text":"Frequency"},{"text":"View-through rate"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 3 — Analytics + Campaign Planning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is where the student should become employable."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Excel"},{"type":"list","items":[{"tex